  "summary": "Strictly scale-invariant CVRP select_next_node heuristic combining two-phase depot start, state-only inward spiral alpha_eff, elongation rho, cos(theta_0), and adaptive early depot return; selected on ana72, reducing P0-120 total tour length by 4.92% [4.22%, 5.67%] (109/120 wins) vs paired control.",
